      "title": "Qwen-Audio-3.0系列语音模型正式上线千问AI平台",
      "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIzOTU0NTQ0MA==&mid=2247561890&idx=1&sn=9ef07932c013aa647d11056b74bf52a6",
      "date": "2026-08-17T07:56:00.932Z",
